OL,5,G1500 Lynn Bowles
OL,6,     FMusic, entertainment and great
OL,7,     Fguests for your Sunday afternoon.
OL,8,G1700 Roy Noble
OL,9,     FRoy chats to guest Emily Steele
OL,10,     Fabout her new play, and to Paul
OL,11,     FJones from Wrexham, who recently
OL,12,     Fwalked the Wales Coastal Path in
OL,13,     Fmemory of his wife. Plus great
OL,14,     Fstories and music.
OL,15,G1900 New Harmony: A Welshman's Dream
OL,16,     FFrom Newtown, Powys to New
OL,17,     FHarmony, Indiana - the story of
OL,18,     FWelshman Robert Owen's 'great
OL,19,     Fexperiment' seeking a socialist
OL,20,     Futopia. Colin Flynn, now a New
OL,21,     FHarmony resident, reports.
